      "writtenOn": "2021-07-14T23:03:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I record the issue at https://b.corp.google.com/issues/185129900#comment2 which is our focus to improve CarrierConfig on T.\n\nThe phoneId validation here will prevent any flush of carrier config clearing/loading request with invalid phoneId triggered by various SIM state change events.\n\nFor valid phoneId, we do have remain space to improve. But it is more like performance improvement that can be done in T. It is not directly connect to the bug here which is focus on fixing the phone crash.",
